## 2. Prerequisite Checks

### ✅ Pre-Integration Checklist

Before adding a new modality, verify the following:

#### ☐ 2.1 Procedure Data Exists

Confirm your modality has a complete data structure in `procedures-global.js`:

```javascript
const PET_PROCEDURES = {
  WHOLE_BODY: {
    category: "Whole Body",
    icon: "🔬",
    procedures: [
      {
        cpt: "78815",
        label: "PET Whole Body with CT - With Contrast",
        shortLabel: "PET/CT - Contrast",
        useCase: "Oncology staging, metabolic assessment"
      }
    ]
  }
};
```

#### ☐ 2.2 Required Fields Present

Each procedure entry MUST include:

| Field | Required | Type | Example |
|-------|----------|------|---------|
| `category` | ✅ Yes | string | "Whole Body", "Brain" |
| `icon` | ✅ Yes | string | "🔬", "🩺" |
| `procedures` | ✅ Yes | array | `[{ }]` |
| `procedures[].cpt` | ✅ Yes | string | "78815" |
| `procedures[].label` | ✅ Yes | string | "PET Whole Body..." |
| `procedures[].shortLabel` | ⚠️ Recommended | string | "PET/CT" |
| `procedures[].useCase` | ⚠️ Recommended | string | "Oncology staging" |
| `procedures[].tags` | ⚪ Optional | string[] | `["oncology", "fdg"]` |

#### ☐ 2.3 No Duplicate CPT Codes

Run this validation in browser console:

```javascript
// Check for CPT duplicates across all modalities
const allCPTs = [];
const ProcLib = window.ProcedureLibrary;

Object.keys(ProcLib).forEach(modality => {
  Object.values(ProcLib[modality]).forEach(category => {
    const procs = category.procedures || category.viewOptions || [];
    procs.forEach(p => allCPTs.push({cpt: p.cpt, modality}));
  });
});

const duplicates = allCPTs.filter((item, index) => 
  allCPTs.findIndex(x => x.cpt === item.cpt) !== index
);

if (duplicates.length > 0) {
  console.error("⚠️ Duplicate CPT codes found:", duplicates);
} else {
  console.log("✅ No CPT duplicates");
}
```

