## 6.3 **NEW:** Configuring Search Result Limits

### Default Limits

```javascript
function searchUniversalProcedures(query, limit = 12) { ... }
function searchLocalProcedures(query, limit = 12) { ... }
```

### When to Increase Limits:

- Adding many detailed body part sections (e.g., 6 CT extremities)
- "Generic term" searches return many results (e.g., "CT upper")
- User feedback indicates missing relevant results

### Performance Considerations:

| Limit | Performance | Use Case |
|-------|-------------|----------|
| 8 | < 50ms | Small procedure libraries (<100 procedures) |
| 12 | < 75ms | **Recommended default** (100-200 procedures) |
| 20 | < 100ms | Large libraries (200+ procedures) |
| 50+ | > 100ms | Not recommended (UI clutter + performance impact) |

