## 12. Troubleshooting

### Common Issues and Solutions

#### Issue 1: "Universal Index is Empty"

**Symptom:**
```
⚠️ Universal index is empty
```

**Causes:**
- `procedures-global.js` not loaded yet
- New modality not added to `window.ProcedureLibrary`
- TypeScript global declaration missing

**Solution:**
```javascript
// 1. Check if ProcedureLibrary exists
console.log(window.ProcedureLibrary);

// 2. Verify your modality is present
console.log(window.ProcedureLibrary.PET);

// 3. Check global declaration in universal-search-index.ts
declare global {
  interface Window {
    ProcedureLibrary: {
      // ... existing modalities
      PET: any;  // ← Add this
    };
  }
}
```

---

#### Issue 2: "No Results for New Modality"

**Symptom:**
```javascript
window.searchUniversalProcedures("pet", 10);
// Returns: []
```

**Causes:**
- Searchable text doesn't include modality keyword
- Tags are missing modality identifier
- `normalizeText()` stripping important terms

**Solution:**
```javascript
// Ensure searchable includes modality keyword
searchable: normalizeText(
  `pet positron emission tomography ...`  // ← Must include "pet"
),

// Ensure tags include keyword
tags: [
  "pet",  // ← Must include primary keyword
  "positron emission tomography",
  // ...
],
```

---

#### Issue 3: "Duplicate CPT Codes"

**Symptom:**
```
⚠️ Duplicate CPT codes found: ["78815", "78815"]
```

**Causes:**
- Same CPT used across multiple modalities
- Typo in CPT code
- Copied procedure without changing CPT

**Solution:**
```javascript
// Run duplicate detector
const allProcs = window.buildUniversalIndex();
const cptMap = new Map();

allProcs.forEach(p => {
  if (cptMap.has(p.cpt)) {
    console.error(`Duplicate CPT ${p.cpt}:`, cptMap.get(p.cpt), p);
  } else {
    cptMap.set(p.cpt, p);
  }
});
```

**Fix:** Update duplicate CPTs to correct values or remove duplicates.

---

#### Issue 4: "Search is Slow"

**Symptom:**
```javascript
console.time("search");
window.searchUniversalProcedures("pet brain", 10);
console.timeEnd("search");
// Output: search: 250ms ← Too slow!
```

**Causes:**
- Too many procedures (>500)
- Searchable strings too long
- Inefficient tag arrays

**Solution:**
```javascript
// 1. Optimize searchable text length
searchable: normalizeText(
  // Remove redundant words, keep it concise
  `pet ${item.category} ${proc.label} ${proc.cpt}`  // Simplified
),

// 2. Limit tag count to < 10 per procedure
tags: [
  "pet",
  item.category.toLowerCase(),
  ...proc.tags.slice(0, 5)  // Limit tags
],

// 3. Consider caching the index
let cachedIndex = null;

export function buildUniversalIndex() {
  if (cachedIndex) return cachedIndex;
  // ... build logic
  cachedIndex = index;
  return index;
}
```

